    "description": "Private Single-Family Home with Garage & Views | Castro/Eureka Valley\n\nExperience true San Francisco living in this completely detached, private single-family home offering stunning downtown views and total independence. This standalone house provides exceptional privacy with no shared walls and its own attached garage with laundry - a rare find in the city!\n\nThere is no yard but steps away from Kite Hill. \n\nPRIVACY & SETTING:\n- Fully detached single-family home - no neighbors above or below\n- Peaceful setting with scenic San Francisco topography views along one side\n- Stunning views of San Francisco's iconic topography - watch the city cascade down the hillsides beneath Twin Peaks and Sutro Tower\n- Completely private with no shared walls\n- Serene, quiet location\n- Abundant street parking available\n\nRECENT UPDATES:\n- Modern kitchen featuring new quartz countertops, expanded layout, standard-size dishwasher, and new sink/faucet\n- Fully refreshed bathroom with new vanity, sink, hardware, shower fixtures, and tile flooring\n- Refinished hardwood floors throughout\n- Fresh paint and updated lighting\n- New matching hardware and electrical upgrades\n\nAMENITIES:\n- Attached garage with washer/dryer\n- Panoramic SF views from kitchen, bedroom, and living room\n- Bright, open living space with modern lighting\n- Spacious kitchen with dining nook overlooking the city\n- Excellent storage space\n- Private entrance\n\nLOCATION:\n- Walking distance to Castro's restaurants, shops, and entertainment\n- Easy access to public transportation\n- Quiet, secluded neighborhood\n- Minutes to tech shuttles, MUNI, and major commute routes\n\nThis thoughtfully renovated home offers the privacy of single-family living with all the conveniences of city life.\n\nWater and garbage covered. Tenant is responsible for gas and electric."
  },
